Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're oh so happy, Yisho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been pushing for this forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you got your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords have been abolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I stood firmly against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when the guys at the top make\Nthe call, there's no reversing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should know that justice\Ncomes with a price tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think is paying that price?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still can't see the\Nbigger picture, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because you've never\Nbeen one of the innocent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,folks this cruel world has\Nchewed up and spit out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happens every day to good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.47,0:00:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seven warlords are now no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are gonna get a bit rocky,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.24,0:01:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we'll need to put our trust\Nin our special science group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power balance in this world\Nis about to shift drastically!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the only thing\Nupside down right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word has it that Kaido and Big\NMom are joining forces in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be the legendary
