Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing legendary about this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as real as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's our problem to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.74,0:01:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, they don't\Ncare how busy we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just the latest\Nfiasco on our plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.34,0:02:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two Emperors of the Sea teamed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really pulling this right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.74,0:02:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, technically speaking, the\Nintel reports they're about to unite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been no damages as of this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we don't understand their\Nmotives or how to handle this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only have a single detail\Nconfirmed at this current time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both hail from the\Nnotorious rocks pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though actual details on the\Nrocks crew are fairly sparse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Mom and Kaido have been at\Nodds with one another for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.06,0:02:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is coming out of left field.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I could have predicted this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I may, who are the Rocks Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't know much about them\Nsince they came long before your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rocks Pirates were a\Ngang of extremely dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,individuals who came together on\Nthe pirate island of Fullalad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:03:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their entire allegiance was founded\Nin order to make one big score.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were such a vicious\Nbunch of scoundrels
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that they'd often kill\Ntheir own crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Rock's lineup consisted\Nof many heavy hitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This included Whitebeard,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that it's hard to\Nbelieve, but trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were all once part\Nof the same pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe that's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazingly enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those three weren't the only crew members\Nwho went on to make a name for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as an example,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some of the other prestigious members\Nincluded Chaka the Golden Lion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Silver Axe, Captain\NJohn and Wong Ji. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those maniacs were on the same crew\Nand they didn't wipe each other out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can this story be lost to history?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they hated their crewmates that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, they wouldn't\Nwant to tell their tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back then, Captain Rocks was\Nfighting to be king of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were openly hostile\Nto the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should have been\Nconsidered terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But many of their incidents\Nwere covered up because
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the truth was discomforting\Nand made us look weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that it mattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when they ruled the seas, everyone\Nwas well aware of the threat they posed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the news broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The God Valley incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just 38 years ago.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.52,0:05:02.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,0)\fnKakumin Web\b1\bord0\fs60\an2\blur1.2\pos(932,765)\c&HF6F6F6&\fscx130\fscy130}38 Years Ago
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.52,0:05:02.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,0)\fnKakumin Web\b1\bord2.5\1a&HFF&\fs60\blur1.2\an2\c&HF6F6F6&\pos(932,765)\fscx130\fscy130\t(0,440,\1a&H7F&)}38 Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fiercest crew in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:05:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Rocks Pirates, had been\Ncompletely annihilated on that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That rampaging force of evil\Nthat no one was able to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before had been crushed by\Nthe Navy Vice Admiral Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name soon reached\Nthe ends of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day he became known as\Nthe Great Hero of the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he was a badass, but I\Nnever heard how he got that title.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's more than earned it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard a hundred tales of\Nheroism about Vice Admiral Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe such an\Nimportant one when unnoticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really taken on all the\Nbig-shot pirates, and he won no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Mom and Kaido have\Nallied with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When can we catch a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't heard much because the\Nman himself refuses to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he doesn't like it much, I'll tell\Nyou the tale so it isn't lost to history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were two reasons why this\Nwas never reported to the presses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first being he had to work alongside\Npirates in order to win the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He protected the Celestial\NDragons in doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did they tie into all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it the Navy's duty\Nto keep them safe, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Garp's own moral compass\Nthat tells him otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A major reason why he's refused the\Npromotion to Admiral stems from the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fact that it would place him directly\Nunder the Celestial Dragon's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his accomplishments\Nand reputation that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prevent him from being\Ndismissed for insubordination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself for the next part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garp had to act quickly to protect the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial Dragons and\Ntheir slaves at God Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With no other options left,\Nhe joined forces with Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, they pooled their numbers\Nto defeat the Rocks Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the truth of\Nthe God Valley incident.
