Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like Gold Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fought together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial Dragons, Gold\NRoger, and the Rocks Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You listed off so many big names.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe all those people\Nwere there at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How have I not even heard\Nof this God Valley place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look for it on a modern day map.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't find that\Nisland's name anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For good reason, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It disappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government wanted to hide\Nwhat happened on that island,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they made it disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing this, do you still\Nwant to hear more of the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, Rox was thwarted\Nby his own ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He broke one too many taboos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tales of his heinous crimes\Nwere deemed unfit for the public,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so he came to exist only in legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a legacy that only lingers in the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,memories of a few old\Nmarines from my generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this was years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's crazy to think one man\Nled three of the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Rocks was Gold\NRoger's very first foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and perhaps his greatest one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That aside, there was something very\Ninteresting that those two had in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it was rarely spoken, Rock's\Nfull name was Rocks D. Jibak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had a special trait some pirates\Nshare, that being the D initial,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although he is no longer\Nalive to speak of it.
