Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then this would be the birth of the\Nmost dangerous pirate crew in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Brain, why don't you tell\Nus what everyone's bounties will be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but keep in mind that\Nwe'll have to go back to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the drawing board on the\Nbounties for the Warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since they've had their\Nimmunity stripped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the other big shots, we\Ncan go over their numbers easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the\Nnewest Emperor of the Sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who attained his title about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gained popularity after\Nhis assault on Impel Down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two years back. Now occupying\Nthe pirate island, Fuller.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-led He continues to expand\Nhis territory and influence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While filling the void\Nthat Whitebeard left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore of the Blackbeard\NPirates Marshal D.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teach 2,247,600,000 berries
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:11:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the next bounty, this man has\Nbeen an emperor for six years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the youngest of the four and\Ndeeply admired by his subordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whom you probably have heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beckman, Rue, Yasopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each with a high average\Nbounty themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pirate crew is world-renowned for\Nhaving an excellent balance of skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There really are no\Nweaklings amongst them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chief of the Red-Hair Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red-Hair Shanks! He's set\Nat 4,048,900,000 belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was born a monster who\Nallegedly destroyed an entire
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,village of giants in Elbaf!\NWhen she was just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not one of her 85 children,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or at least related by blood, you\Nwill naturally be mistrusted by her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the undisputed queen of the sweet-themed\Nnetwork of islands known as Totoland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, of course, the captain of\Nthe Big Mom Pirates! Charlotte Linlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's worth 4,388,000,000 belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, we have a monster who made\Na name for himself early on in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man was only an apprentice\Nwhen he joined the Rock's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won the respect of the most ferocious
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of pirates through his\Nsheer strength alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until he was worthy of earning\Nthe title Emperor of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supreme Commander of\Nthe Beast Pirates Kaido,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King of the Beasts! Worth\N4,611,100,000 Berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How distressing Now it goes without\Nsaying But they decided at the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reverie That we will no longer\Nhave the Warlords at our disposal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only time will tell if distancing ourselves\Nwas a good decision or not we'll have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to wait and see how the navy's special
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,science team the ssg\Nperforms since we're here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll put this in perspective i might as
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well share the bounties\Nof some other legends
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the captain of the white beard pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,edward newgate 5 billion\N46 million berries
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.98,0:13:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain of the Roger\NPirates The king of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates Gold Roger 5 billion\N564 million 800 thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been a bounty to\Nsurpass these two At least not yet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if Big Mom and Kaido\Nform their alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:14:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their combined bounty will be the\Nhighest the world has ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the size of their crew will be huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've read the reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is happening as we speak in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sakazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be getting involved with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you went senile,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we lack the manpower and resources\Nto handle this currently.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never intended to get involved anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This old man was simply\Nproviding these young
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soldiers with some wisdom and experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, pirates are humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have their own\Nrelationships and reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't take action without\Nknowing their history.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:15:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, there was a pirate\Nfrom Wano who Whitebeard was fond of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was favored by Roger and Red Hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Kozuki Odin, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who once served as a\Ncommander on Whitebeard's ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None other, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not all he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The King of the Pirates recruited\Nhim for his final journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's not adding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I can't imagine Odin\Nbeing connected, it seems odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it make you question\Nwhy all these huge players have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such close ties to an isolated\Ncountry like the land of Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do well to keep your\Neyes open, Sakazuki.
